# Only the two bundles, the media and the docs ship in the .vsix. vsce applies every `!` pattern
# after all ignores, so the bundles are named exactly (a `!dist/**` would bring source maps back).
**
!dist/extension.js
!dist/webview/run.js
!dist/webview/panels.js
!media/**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
